# k.actions/shards/verbs-greet: 5 verbs and phrasal verbs that mean the act "greet" (greet, say hello, say hi, welcome, hail ...): the WordNet senses read for it, the role of the object, what the verb itself says, and the prepositions that mark a role after this verb.
